<title>BRAZIL: Brazil soycomplex registrations to May 15 - Abiove.</title>
<headline>Brazil soycomplex registrations to May 15 - Abiove.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian export registrations of soybeans, soymeal and soyoil to May 15 were as follows, according to the Brazilian Vegetable Oil Industries Association (Abiove).</p>
<p>Quantities in thousands of tonnes are for the marketing year (February/January).</p>
<p>		1997/98	 1996/97</p>
<p> Soybeans	   7,184	   2,976</p>
<p> Soymeal	    6,685	   6,131</p>
<p> Soyoil		 625	     782</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
